{
    "title": "BIGVU Teleprompter & Captions",
    "description": "Teleprompter for Videos: BIGVU's AI-Powered Video Maker\r\n\r\nEnhance your video creation with BIGVU, an all-in-one app video teleprompter and captions app. AI-powered editing tools help you make professional videos effortlessly.\r\n\r\nElegant Teleprompter for Perfectly Delivered Scripts\r\n- Use the floating teleprompter to seamlessly read your script while maintaining eye contact with your audience.\r\n- Adjust the speed and size of the text in the smart prompter, ensuring you always stay on point.\r\n-  Keep your eyes on the camera by reading your script scrolling down the screen\r\n- Create compelling video scripts effortlessly with BIGVU\u2019s AI Magic Writer, designed to help you craft power scripts for your autocue.\r\n\r\nAutomatic Subtitles \r\n- Add subtitles to the lower third of your video for a professional touch.\r\n- Customize captions with your brand colors for a cohesive look.\r\nSeamless Video Integration:\r\n- Automatically resize and crop your captions for optimal impact on social media platforms.\r\n- Add your branding, logo, and background AI music with the built-in video editor.\r\n\r\nAI Eye Contact:\r\n- Ensure seamless eye contact with your audience, enhancing trust and connection even when reading from a script.\r\n- Automatically adjust your gaze, giving the impression of direct eye contact throughout your video.\r\n- Perfect for presentations, tutorials, and personal messages where authenticity and connection are key.\r\n\r\n\r\nEdit videos using the automatic transcript\r\n- Trim and cut clips by just selecting  the words \r\n- Easily select the start and end points of your video by tapping on selected words of your video transcription\r\n- Preview the trimmed video before finalizing the edit\r\n- Access easy undo and redo options\r\n- Fine-tuning controls for frame-by-frame adjustments\r\n- Seamless integration with Descript to enhance the overall editing workflow\r\n\r\nAI Music Generator\r\n- Elevate your videos with custom background music created by the AI Music Generator.\r\n- Choose from a variety of music styles that fit the tone and mood of your content.\r\n- Integrate AI-generated music seamlessly into your videos for a polished final product.\r\n\r\nLive Beauty Camera Filters\r\n- Enjoy advanced real-time face beautification effects including skin smoothing, skin tone enhancement, face morphing, teeth whitening, and soft lighting. \r\n- Enhance your on-camera appearance with eye makeup.\r\n- Add makeup filters for a polished and natural look.\r\n- Use a variety of face filters to match the style and theme of your video, ensuring you always look your best.\r\n\r\nBIGVU's AI-powered captions app is your go-to solution for engaging videos that captivate your audience.\r\n\r\nVisit our website for more information:\r\nBIGVU Website - https://bigvu.tv/\r\nAdd Captions to Videos- https://bigvu.tv/create/auto-captions\r\nTeleprompter App - https://bigvu.tv/create/teleprompter-app\r\nAI Magic Writer for Video Scripts - https://bigvu.tv/create/ai-magic-writer-for-video-scripts\r\n\r\nTraining videos on how to create stunning videos with the BIGVU Teleprompter are available here: https://desk.bigvu.tv/course",
    "descriptionHTML": "Teleprompter for Videos: BIGVU&#39;s AI-Powered Video Maker<br><br>Enhance your video creation with BIGVU, an all-in-one app video teleprompter and captions app. AI-powered editing tools help you make professional videos effortlessly.<br><br>Elegant Teleprompter for Perfectly Delivered Scripts<br>- Use the floating teleprompter to seamlessly read your script while maintaining eye contact with your audience.<br>- Adjust the speed and size of the text in the smart prompter, ensuring you always stay on point.<br>-  Keep your eyes on the camera by reading your script scrolling down the screen<br>- Create compelling video scripts effortlessly with BIGVU\u2019s AI Magic Writer, designed to help you craft power scripts for your autocue.<br><br>Automatic Subtitles <br>- Add subtitles to the lower third of your video for a professional touch.<br>- Customize captions with your brand colors for a cohesive look.<br>Seamless Video Integration:<br>- Automatically resize and crop your captions for optimal impact on social media platforms.<br>- Add your branding, logo, and background AI music with the built-in video editor.<br><br>AI Eye Contact:<br>- Ensure seamless eye contact with your audience, enhancing trust and connection even when reading from a script.<br>- Automatically adjust your gaze, giving the impression of direct eye contact throughout your video.<br>- Perfect for presentations, tutorials, and personal messages where authenticity and connection are key.<br><br><br>Edit videos using the automatic transcript<br>- Trim and cut clips by just selecting  the words <br>- Easily select the start and end points of your video by tapping on selected words of your video transcription<br>- Preview the trimmed video before finalizing the edit<br>- Access easy undo and redo options<br>- Fine-tuning controls for frame-by-frame adjustments<br>- Seamless integration with Descript to enhance the overall editing workflow<br><br>AI Music Generator<br>- Elevate your videos with custom background music created by the AI Music Generator.<br>- Choose from a variety of music styles that fit the tone and mood of your content.<br>- Integrate AI-generated music seamlessly into your videos for a polished final product.<br><br>Live Beauty Camera Filters<br>- Enjoy advanced real-time face beautification effects including skin smoothing, skin tone enhancement, face morphing, teeth whitening, and soft lighting. <br>- Enhance your on-camera appearance with eye makeup.<br>- Add makeup filters for a polished and natural look.<br>- Use a variety of face filters to match the style and theme of your video, ensuring you always look your best.<br><br>BIGVU&#39;s AI-powered captions app is your go-to solution for engaging videos that captivate your audience.<br><br>Visit our website for more information:<br>BIGVU Website - https://bigvu.tv/<br>Add Captions to Videos- https://bigvu.tv/create/auto-captions<br>Teleprompter App - https://bigvu.tv/create/teleprompter-app<br>AI Magic Writer for Video Scripts - https://bigvu.tv/create/ai-magic-writer-for-video-scripts<br><br>Training videos on how to create stunning videos with the BIGVU Teleprompter are available here: https://desk.bigvu.tv/course",
